# Mobile app environment variables (optional)
#
# @maplibre/maplibre-react-native does not require any API keys.
# The map uses OpenFreeMap tiles by default (free, no key needed).
#
# The WMS overlay comes from Geonorge's public WMS service (free).
#
# If you need to override the base map style, set:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_BASE_MAP_STYLE=https://tiles.openfreemap.org/styles/liberty
